// surge-xt — Surge XT, a full hybrid synthesizer built into the engine: three oscillators per scene over a dozen
// algorithms, two filters from forty models, waveshapers, twelve modulators and a routing matrix, two effect chains.
// What it plays is a PATCH, a BASE under base/: 608 of Surge's factory patches by category, GPL-3 like Surge.
//
// A patch carries its own wavetables, so the engine needs no Surge install. Every parameter but the MIDI ones is a
// param here, the patch's value until this file sets one; the panel is generated (engine/k7-runtime/docs/surgePlugin.md).
extends("@engine/surge-xt")
base("Pads/Bell Pad")
// Surge XT, the open-source hybrid synthesizer: subtractive, wavetable, FM and physical voices, with 608 factory patches to start from — pads, leads, basses, plucks, keys, brass.
